{
  "schemaVersion": "huqan-knowledge-wiki-fixture-v1",
  "issue": 4144,
  "note": "Data only. These cases describe a derived, read-only knowledge view over existing records; they define no store and no write path. Every hash here is synthetic and is drift detection, not tamper evidence.",
  "cases": [
    {
